# Commits

- English Conventional Commits.
- Types: `feat`, `fix`, `docs`, `chore`, `refactor`.
- Prefer scopes: `web`, `server`, `cli`, `core`.
- Other scopes only when it does not fit those (`repo`, `ci`, or omit scope for pure `docs:`).

```text
feat(core): resolve commit to quest by ticket match
feat(web): add pause quest sheet with falta field
feat(cli): add ingest-commit command
feat(server): expose POST /api/commits
docs: update PLAN locked decisions
chore(repo): add pnpm workspace
```

- Prefer one logical change per commit when the user asks to commit.
- Do not commit unless the user explicitly asks.
